2. **rule 3: story props close together.** The story props (leaving out no-2 board) fill a box 0.61 of the frame wide and 0.25 tall (limit 0.40 x 0.50). Its edges: man 5's left side (0.20 across), petrol drum's right side (0.80), no-2 gateway's top (0.42 down) and diesel drum's bottom (0.67).
